intage halo.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Art Deco Hexagon Halo (Zac Posen, 3/4 ct.)</strong></td><td>14k Rose Gold</td><td><a href="https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/zac-zac-posen-art-deco-hexagon-halo-diamond-engagement-ring-in-14k-rose-gold-3-4-ct-tw-item-203817?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational">$4,175</a></td><td>1920s hexagon geometric vintage.</td></tr><tr class="highlight-row"><td><strong>Floral Side Stone Platinum (JA)</strong></td><td>Platinum</td><td><a href="https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/floral-side-stone-diamond-engagement-ring-in-platinum-by-james-allen-item-304661?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational">$4,660</a></td><td>Platinum floral side stone.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Romantic Floral Halo Platinum (1/2 ct.)</strong></td><td>Platinum</td><td><a href="https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/romantic-diamond-floral-halo-engagement-ring-in-platinum-1-2-ct-tw-item-150342?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational">$5,280</a></td><td>Platinum floral halo + 1/2 ct accents.</td></tr><tr class="highlight-row"><td><strong>Vintage Diamond Halo Platinum (5/8 ct., CEILING)</strong></td><td>Platinum</td><td><a href="https://www.bluenile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/vintage-diamond-halo-engagement-ring-in-platinum-5-8-ct-tw-item-146556?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational">$5,495</a></td><td>Single-centre ceiling. Platinum + 5/8 ct halo.</td></tr></tbody></table>

