ile.com/engagement-rings/design-your-own-ring/enchanted-scroll-vintage-style-engagement-ring-in-platinum-by-james-allen-item-315306?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational">Enchanted Scroll Platinum $2,090</a></td><td>Pan-era classic. Works across eras.</td></tr></tbody></table>

